### Uses variables from .vscode/settings.json (local/production)

### Verify a German IBAN (BIC may be resolved via external fallback provider, if enabled)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/iban/verify?iban=DE75%205121%200800%201245%201261%2099
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Verify a French IBAN (BIC may be resolved from local lookup data if the bank code exists in the bundled dataset)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/iban/verify?iban=FR76%2030006%200001%201234567890189
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Verify a Dutch IBAN (BIC may be resolved via external fallback provider, if enabled)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/iban/verify?iban=NL02ABNA0123456789
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Verify an IBAN with invalid checksum
GET {{host}}/api/v1/iban/verify?iban=DE75%205121%200800%201245%201261%2098
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Verify an IBAN and request XML response
GET {{host}}/api/v1/iban/verify?iban=DE75%205121%200800%201245%201261%2099&format=xml
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}